 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "TokenLimiter() starts with no users. setPolicy(userId, maxTokens, refillAmount, refillInterval, timestamp) creates or replaces the user's bucket: it is full (maxTokens) at timestamp, and refills happen at timestamp + k * refillInterval for k = 1, 2, .... Each refill adds refillAmount tokens, capped at maxTokens. consume(userId, tokens, timestamp) first applies every refill due at or before timestamp, then removes tokens and returns true when the bucket holds at least that many; otherwise it removes nothing and returns false. An unknown user cannot consume (false). getTokens(userId, timestamp) applies due refills and returns the bucket level, or -1 for an unknown user. Timestamps never decrease across calls.",
  "provenance": [
   {
    "repository": "gamma",
    "revision": null,
    "path": "projects/algorithm_solver/catalogue/authored/hack2hire-chunk10-b-20261028-v1/contracts.json",
    "sha256": "0829f1b98e3a4aa7bfc32413e21359791d60ea7c8efe9cf209942feec47b0ca8",
    "selector": "/problems/0/inferred_spec"
   }
  ]
 },
 "contentScope": "authored",
 "requirements": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": [
   "TokenLimiter() starts with no users.",
   "setPolicy(userId, maxTokens, refillAmount, refillInterval, timestamp) creates or replaces the user's bucket: it is full (maxTokens) at timestamp, and refills happen at timestamp + k * refillInterval for k = 1, 2, ...",
   "Each refill adds refillAmount tokens, capped at maxTokens.",
   "consume(userId, tokens, timestamp) first applies every refill due at or before timestamp, then removes tokens and returns true when the bucket holds at least that many; otherwise it removes nothing and returns false.",
   "An unknown user cannot consume (false).",
   "getTokens(userId, timestamp) applies due refills and returns the bucket level, or -1 for an unknown user.",
   "Timestamps never decrease across calls."
  ],
